{"availability":"available","full":"guardianproject/haven","name":"haven","description":"Haven is for people who need a way to protect their personal spaces and possessions without compromising their own privacy, through an Android app and on-device sensors","category":"Other","language":"Java","stars":6818,"forks":751,"created":"2017-03-01T03:20:03Z","updated":"2022-10-26T22:43:24Z","license":"GPL-3.0","branch":"master","homepage":"https://guardianproject.github.io/haven/","topics":["android","device-sensors","monitoring-service","prototype-android-application","sensor"],"demo":"https://guardianproject.github.io/haven/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T13:03:36.272Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-10T13:03:36.272Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-10T13:03:36.272Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-10T13:03:36.272Z","stars":6818,"forks":751}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Haven is for people who need a way to protect their personal areas and possessions without compromising their privacy. It is an Android application that leverages on-device sensors to provide monitoring and protection of physical areas. Haven turns any Android phone into a motion, sound, vibration and light detector, watching for unexpected guests and unwanted intruders. We designed Haven for investigative journalists, human rights defenders and people at risk of forced disappearance to create a new kind of herd immunity. By combining the array of sensors found in any smartphone, with the…","View our full Haven App Overview presentation for more about the origins and goals of the project.","While we hope to support a version of Haven that runs directly on iOS devices in the future, iPhone users can still benefit from Haven today. You can purchase an inexpensive Android phone for less than $100 and use it as your \"Haven Device\"; leaving it behind whilst you keep your iPhone on you. If you run Signal on your iPhone you can configure Haven on Android to send encrypted notifications, with photos and audio, directly to you. If you enable the \"Tor Onion Service\" feature in Haven (requires installation of \"Orbot\" app as well) you can remotely access all Haven log data from your iPhone…"],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/guardianproject/haven/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"31aeb608ab05ede81955b9c28dfdb70e294a7134dd242c8b72b1ae4711d57134","extractedAt":"2026-10-10T13:03:36.376Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-10T13:03:36.376Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Haven is for people who need a way to protect their personal areas and possessions without compromising their privacy. It is an Android application that leverages on-device sensors to provide monitoring and protection of physical areas. Haven turns any Android phone into a motion, sound, vibration and light detector, watching for unexpected guests and unwanted intruders. We designed Haven for investigative journalists, human rights defenders and people at risk of forced disappearance to create a new kind of herd immunity. By combining the array of sensors found in any smartphone, with the…","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/guardianproject/haven/blob/master/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"31aeb608ab05ede81955b9c28dfdb70e294a7134dd242c8b72b1ae4711d57134","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/guardianproject/haven/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T13:03:36.376Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2022-10-26T22:43:24Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/guardianproject/haven/blob/master/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-10T13:03:36.377Z","hash":"31aeb608ab05ede81955b9c28dfdb70e294a7134dd242c8b72b1ae4711d57134","originalBytes":9854,"storedBytes":9854,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["haven","project","android","apache","app","sensors","device","phone","through","iphone","notifications","signal","their","about","motion","onion","f-droid","guardian","light","mi